3GPP TSG RAN WG1 #110 R1-2206076 Toulouse, France, August 22th - 26th, 2022 Title: Draft reply LS on clarification of RACH prioritisation rules between LTE and NR-U Response to: R4-2211170 Release: Release-16 Work Item: NR_unlic-core Source: ZTE, Sanechips To: RAN WG4 Cc: - Contact Person: Name: Mengzhen Li E-mail Address: li.mengzhen@zte.com.cn 1. Overall Description: RAN1 would like to thank RAN4 for their LS in R4-2211170. RAN1 confirm that RAN4’s working assumption for collision of LTE RACH and NR-U RACH is in line with RAN1 spec which is described in section 7.6.1 of TS 38.213. The existing prioritization rules for LTE and NR transmission collision are also applicable for NR-U and RACH collision. 2. Actions: To RAN4: RAN1 kindly asks RAN4 to take the above responses into account. 3. Date of Next RAN1 Meetings: RAN1 Meeting #110bis-e 10 Oct – 19 Oct e-meeting RAN1 Meeting #111 14 Nov – 18 Nov Canada
